ia Tolima El Naranjal Yellow Bourbon Washed\n   </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    Mexico Veracruz Tetla Bourbon/Typica Anaerobic Natural\n   </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    China Yunnan Baoshan Zuo Farm Bourbon Anaerobic Natural\n   </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://j.youzan.com/JR_tI2\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"点击👉报名\">\n  点击👉报名\n </a>\n</section>\n",
